# The Water of Life (scripts/check_water_of_life.sh): the setup
# (dune_story_setup=water-of-life) puts Paul in a sietch's room 4 with
# Stilgar and answers his offer three ways (REFUSE; ACCEPT with charisma 120,
# Paul comes to three hours later and Jessica's lesson makes the range
# unlimited; ACCEPT with charisma 50, Paul dies); everything happens during
# the setup.
#
# Comments after '#' on a command line say what a click hits and what a
# wait lets finish; scripts/dune_script_trace.py prints what each line did.
wait 15000              # the story setup runs (the three offers and Jessica's lesson)
checkpoint water-of-life-end
quit
